{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34711","headline":"夏日闲居作四声诗寄袭美 平声 · 陆龟蒙","name":"夏日闲居作四声诗寄袭美 平声","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"荒池菰蒲深，闲阶莓苔平。\n江边松篁多，人家帘栊清。\n爲书凌遗编，调弦夸新声。\n求欢虽殊途，探幽聊怡情。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34711.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34711","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}